     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap KBV-CM-MIO-LAB-Overview</b></p><a name=\"KBV-CM-MIO-LAB-Overview\"> </a><a name=\"hcKBV-CM-MIO-LAB-Overview\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-administrative-gender.html\">AdministrativeGenderversion: 4.0.1)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-KBV-CS-MIO-LAB-AdministrativeGender-German.html\">AdministrativeGender Germanversion: 1.0.0-update)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>female</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Weiblich</td></tr><tr><td>male</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Maennlich (Männlich)</td></tr><tr><td>other</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Andere</td></tr><tr><td>unknown</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Unbekannt</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>http://snomed.info/sct|http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/version/20251115</code> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-KBV-CS-MIO-LAB-Bodystructure-Body-Landmark-Clock-Face-Position-G.html\">Bodystructure Clock Face Position SNOMED CT® Germanversion: 1.0.0-update)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>260318004 (1 o'clock position)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalen